error[Z0401]: `method:` of `fill_missing` fills down a column, but `x` is an Int
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:14
  |
1 | fill_missing(3, method: backward)
  |              ^ one value, with no row before or after it
  |
  = help: write it inside `add` or `update`, as in `d.add(filled = fill_missing(x, method: forward))`; `fill_missing(x, 0)` fills one value

